The '''Rift Dimension''' is a location accessible through the {{Zone|Wizard Tower}}, unlocked upon reaching {{SkyBlock Level|12}}. By acquiring a [[Wizard|Dimensional Infusion]], players can enter the Rift Dimension and progress through it, securing [[Rift Timecharms]] in the {{Zone|Rift Gallery}} and progressing through the [[Rift Guide]].

== Dimensional Infusion ==
The '''Rift''' can be accessed by entering the [[Wizard Tower#Wizard Portal|Wizard Portal]] in the [[Wilderness|Wilderness]] by the mountain.

Players gain a free {{Pink|Dimensional Infusion}} every {{Green|4}} hours. Up to {{Green|3}} free {{Pink|Dimensional Infusions}} can be stored and used later.

Additionally, there are 4 more ways for a player to obtain a {{Pink|Dimensional Infusion}} which is needed to enter the Rift:
*Paying {{NPCSprite|Wizard}} {{Item|Grand Experience Bottle|amount=32}}s.
*Paying {{NPCSprite|Wizard}} {{Bits|200}}.  They can also toggle {{Green|Auto-Buy}}, which automatically purchases {{Pink|Dimensional Infusion}}, but does not keep them in the '''Rift''' once their time runs out.
*Having a {{Item|Rift Prism}} in their inventory or [[Accessory Bag]], or imbued through {{NPCSprite|Erihann}}.
*Accepting the {{NPCSprite|Tal Ker}} [[Visitor]] offer in {{Zone|Garden}}.
A {{Pink|Dimensional Infusion}} is not consumed upon entering the Rift, and is only consumed upon leaving the {{Zone|Wizard Tower (Rift)}}. However, if a player joins the Rift {{Green|3}} times using the same {{Pink|Dimensional Infusion}} it will be finally be consumed with the following message:{{Dialogue|&d&lINFUSION GONE! &7Insta-consumed because you joined 3 rift instances with it!}}

If a server reboot happens while the player is in the Rift, their {{Pink|Dimensional Infusion}} will be refunded.

== Locations ==
The '''Rift'''  has 9 main locations: {{zone|Wyld Woods}}, {{Zone|Black Lagoon}}, {{Zone|West Village}}, {{Zone|Dreadfarm}}, {{Zone|Village Plaza}}, {{Zone|Living Cave}}, {{Zone|Colosseum (Rift)}}, {{Zone|Stillgore Château}}, and {{Zone|The Mountaintop}}.

The {{Zone|Stillgore Château}} grants the player access to [[Vampire Slayer]].

== Mechanics ==
Items, [[Stats]], and [[Potion]] effects are not retained when between dimensions, and will only be present in their corresponding dimensions, with the exception of {{Rift Transferable}} and {{Rift Exportable}} items.

{{Rift Exportable}} Items lose motes value when transferred between dimensions through the [[Inverted Sirius|Rift Transfer Chest]].

The player will only have the following Stats in the [[Rift]]:
*{{Stat|rt}}
*{{Stat|rift damage}}
*{{Stat|spd}}
*{{Stat|int}}
*{{Stat|mf}}
*{{Stat|mana regen}}
*{{Stat|hearts}}

=== Time ===
{{Main|Rift Time}}

{{Stat|Rift Time}} is a stat that players gain once they enter the '''Rift'''. It determines how much time they have in the dimension before being teleported back to the [[Hub]]. Each point of {{Stat|Rift Time}} the player has represents one second in the '''Rift'''. The player starts off with a base {{Stat|Rift Time}} of {{Green|480s}} or {{Statname|Rift Time|8 Minutes|short=rt|icononly=true}}, but this can be increased with various modifiers. While the player is in the [[Wizard Tower (Rift)|Wizard Tower]] (except for the bottom floor), [[Rift Gallery]] or [[Mirrorverse]], their {{Statname|Rift Time}} does not deplete.

The player is warned when they have {{Green|10s}} remaining in the '''Rift'''. The player will become immune to any time-penalties during this period. If the player obtains more than these  {{Green|10}} remaining seconds (by doing things such as eating a [[Caducous Legume]]), the time-penalties will be still applied until the last {{Green|10s}} remaining, even though now you will not be warned.

=== Motes ===
{{Main|Motes}}
The main currency in the '''Rift''' is {{Motes}}. They are first obtained by coming in contact with orbs that spawn around the '''Rift'''. Orbs give {{Motes|+25}} and {{Stat|rt|+2}} everywhere, except for {{Zone|Enigma's Crib}}, where they give {{Motes|+10}} and no {{Stat|rt|}}. Motes can also be obtained by killing mobs, selling items to the {{NPCSprite|Motes Grubber}} or by completing bosses.

=== Orbs ===
Orbs are particles that spawn in the '''Rift'''. If the player comes in contact with an orb, they will gain {{Motes|+25}} and {{Stat|rt|+2}} or {{Motes|+10}} if the orb is in {{zone|Enigma's Crib}}. Once the player has walked into the orb, it will disappear.

Orbs cannot spawn if there is another in a {{Yellow|20}} block radius, and a maximum of {{Green|100}} orbs can be present on the island.

=== [[Trading]] ===
If the player attempts to [[Trading|Trade]] with another player and the other player accepts the request, they swap positions.

