== Lore ==
*The Rift Dimension became accessible to the main dimension after [[Jythar]] used [[Fel Magic]] to attack it and separate the world of [[SkyBlock]] into islands.
*Many have studied the Breach created on top of the Mountain, including [[Dr. Emmett]], who accidentally became the first human to travel into the Rift Dimension. His adoptive son, Lathrop becomes {{NPCSprite|The Watcher}}.
*Years after [[Barry]], [[Wizard]] and possibly other unspecified wizards, have succeeded in building a portal to safely travel to this dimension.

== Trivia ==
*The only [[Mayors]] that affect the Rift are {{NPCSprite|Diaz}} and {{NPCSprite|Aura}}.
*The player takes no [[Fall Damage]] in the Rift.
*The collectibles being called [[Enigma Souls]] is a reference to [[fandom:arkhamcity:Enigma Datapack|Enigma Datapacks]] from [[fandom:arkhamcity:Batman: Arkham Origins|Batman: Arkham Origins]].

